IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- Telecommunications Act 1999 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation (TA1999.txt).
-- PART 5A (continued): s 41 (directions to enforce conditions imposed on approval under s 38), s 42 (power to obtain information relating to
-- control), s 43 (appointment of chief executive officer, director, etc. of a designated telecommunication licensee).
-- Seat: the specified person, the shareholder or holder asked for information, and the designated licensee that wants to appoint someone.

§ `s 41 Power to issue directions to enforce conditions imposed on approval`

-- src:3970 | 41.—(1) Without affecting section 31, the Authority may issue a
-- src:3971 | direction under subsection (2) if —
-- src:3973 | (a) a person (called in this section the specified person) —
-- src:3975 | (i) is a 12% controller or 30% controller of a designated
-- src:3976 | telecommunication licensee, designated business
-- src:3977 | trust or designated trust;
-- src:3979 | (ii) owns any business (of a designated
-- src:3980 | telecommunication licensee, designated business
-- src:3981 | trust or designated trust) that is conducted under a
-- src:3982 | telecommunication licence granted under section 5,
-- src:3983 | or any part of any such business, as a going concern;
-- src:3984 | or
-- src:3986 | (iii) has effective control over a designated
-- src:3987 | telecommunication licensee, designated business
-- src:3988 | trust or designated trust;
-- src:3990 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3991 | 81 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:3993 | (b) the Authority, in granting its written approval to the
-- src:3994 | specified person under section 38(5), (6) or (7) in respect of
-- src:3995 | any designated telecommunication licensee, designated
-- src:3996 | business trust or designated trust, imposes a condition that
-- src:3997 | the specified person must transfer or dispose of all or any
-- src:3998 | part of —
-- src:4000 | (i) the shares which the specified person holds, or which
-- src:4001 | the specified person and the specified person’s
-- src:4002 | associates together hold, in the designated
-- src:4003 | telecommunication licensee (called in this section
-- src:4004 | the specified shares);
-- src:4006 | (ii) the units which the specified person holds, or which
-- src:4007 | the specified person and the specified person’s
-- src:4008 | associates together hold, in the designated business
-- src:4009 | trust (called in this section the specified units); or
-- src:4011 | (iii) the equity interests which the specified person holds,
-- src:4012 | or which the specified person and the specified
-- src:4013 | person’s associates together hold, in the designated
-- src:4014 | trust (called in this section the specified equity
-- src:4015 | interests); and
-- src:4017 | (c) the Authority is satisfied that the condition has not been
-- src:4018 | complied with.
@ref s 41(1) (src:3970-4018)
GIVEN `the person is a 12% controller or 30% controller of a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person owns, as a going concern, a business (or part) of such a licensee or trust conducted under a telecommunication licence granted under section 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has effective control over such a licensee or trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority, in granting its written approval under section 38(5), (6) or (7), imposed a condition that the person must transfer or dispose of all or any part of the specified shares, units or equity interests` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority is satisfied that the condition has not been complied with` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 41(1): the Authority may issue a direction under subsection (2)` MEANS
        (   `the person is a 12% controller or 30% controller of a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust`
         OR `the person owns, as a going concern, a business (or part) of such a licensee or trust conducted under a telecommunication licence granted under section 5`
         OR `the person has effective control over such a licensee or trust`)
    AND `the Authority, in granting its written approval under section 38(5), (6) or (7), imposed a condition that the person must transfer or dispose of all or any part of the specified shares, units or equity interests`
    AND `the Authority is satisfied that the condition has not been complied with`

-- src:4022 | (2) The Authority may, in the circumstances specified in
-- src:4023 | subsection (1), issue all or any of the following directions:
-- src:4025 | (a) direct the specified person, or any associate of the specified
-- src:4026 | person, to transfer or dispose of all or any part of the
-- src:4027 | specified shares, specified units or specified equity
-- src:4028 | interests (as the case may be) within such time and
-- src:4029 | subject to such conditions as the Authority specifies;
-- src:4031 | (b) direct the specified person to transfer or dispose of all or
-- src:4032 | any part of the business that is conducted under a
-- src:4033 | telecommunication licence granted under section 5, and
-- src:4034 | that is acquired from the designated telecommunication
-- src:4035 | licensee, designated business trust or designated trust as a
-- src:4037 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:4038 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 82
-- src:4040 | going concern, within such time and subject to such
-- src:4041 | conditions as the Authority specifies;
-- src:4043 | (c) direct the specified person to relinquish effective control
-- src:4044 | over the designated telecommunication licensee,
-- src:4045 | designated business trust or designated trust, within such
-- src:4046 | time and subject to such conditions as the Authority
-- src:4047 | specifies;
-- src:4049 | (d) direct —
-- src:4051 | (i) the specified person, or any associate of the specified
-- src:4052 | person, to procure the issue of such number of
-- src:4053 | shares, units or equity interests in the designated
-- src:4054 | telecommunication licensee, designated business
-- src:4055 | trust or designated trust (as the case may be) as the
-- src:4056 | Authority may determine, within such time and
-- src:4057 | subject to such conditions as the Authority specifies;
-- src:4059 | (ii) the designated telecommunication licensee, the
-- src:4060 | trustee‑manager of the designated business trust, or
-- src:4061 | the trustee of the designated trust, to procure the
-- src:4062 | issue of such number of shares, units or equity
-- src:4063 | interests in the designated telecommunication
-- src:4064 | licensee, designated business trust or designated
-- src:4065 | trust (as the case may be) as the Authority may
-- src:4066 | determine, within such time and subject to such
-- src:4067 | conditions as the Authority specifies; and
-- src:4069 | (iii) the specified person, or any associate of the specified
-- src:4070 | person, to transfer or dispose of all or any part of the
-- src:4071 | specified shares, specified units or specified equity
-- src:4072 | interests, in the designated telecommunication
-- src:4073 | licensee, designated business trust or designated
-- src:4074 | trust (as the case may be) within such time and
-- src:4075 | subject to such conditions as the Authority specifies.
@ref s 41(2) (src:4022-4075)
GIVEN direction IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 41(2): the Authority may issue this direction` MEANS
    elem direction (LIST "to the specified person or an associate: transfer or dispose of all or any part of the specified shares, units or equity interests within such time and subject to such conditions as the Authority specifies"
                        , "to the specified person: transfer or dispose of all or any part of the business conducted under a telecommunication licence granted under section 5 and acquired as a going concern, within such time and subject to such conditions as the Authority specifies"
                        , "to the specified person: relinquish effective control over the designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust, within such time and subject to such conditions as the Authority specifies"
                        , "to the specified person or an associate: procure the issue of such number of shares, units or equity interests as the Authority may determine, within such time and subject to such conditions as the Authority specifies"
                        , "to the designated telecommunication licensee, trustee-manager or trustee: procure the issue of such number of shares, units or equity interests as the Authority may determine, within such time and subject to such conditions as the Authority specifies"
                        , "to the specified person or an associate: transfer or dispose of all or any part of the specified shares, units or equity interests within such time and subject to such conditions as the Authority specifies")

-- src:4079 | (3) Before issuing a direction to any person under subsection (2),
-- src:4080 | the Authority must, unless the Authority decides that it is not
-- src:4081 | practicable or desirable to do so, cause to be given to that person
-- src:4082 | written notice of the Authority’s intention to issue the direction,
-- src:4084 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:4085 | 83 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:4087 | specifying a date by which that person may make written
-- src:4088 | representations with regard to the proposed direction.
@ref s 41(3) (src:4079-4088)
GIVEN `the Authority decides that it is not practicable or desirable to give notice` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority caused written notice of its intention to issue the direction to be given to the person, specifying a date by which written representations may be made` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 41(3): the Authority may issue the direction under subsection (2)` MEANS
    `the Authority decides that it is not practicable or desirable to give notice` OR `the Authority caused written notice of its intention to issue the direction to be given to the person, specifying a date by which written representations may be made`

-- src:4092 | (4) Upon receipt of any written representation under subsection (3),
-- src:4093 | the Authority must consider the representation for the purpose of
-- src:4094 | determining whether to issue the direction.
@ref s 41(4) (src:4092-4094)
GIVEN `the Authority received a written representation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority considered it for the purpose of determining whether to issue the direction` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 41(4): the Authority has acted as the subsection requires` MEANS
    (NOT `the Authority received a written representation`) OR `the Authority considered it for the purpose of determining whether to issue the direction`

-- src:4098 | (5) Any person to whom a direction is issued under subsection (2)
-- src:4099 | must comply with the direction.
@ref s 41(5) (src:4098-4099)
GIVEN `a direction was issued to the person under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 41(5): the person must comply with the direction` MEANS
    `a direction was issued to the person under subsection (2)`

-- src:4103 | (6) The Authority may at any time vary, suspend or revoke any
-- src:4104 | direction issued under this section.
@ref s 41(6) (src:4103-4104)
GIVEN `the Authority varies, suspends or revokes a direction issued under section 41` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 41(6): the Authority may at any time vary, suspend or revoke the direction` MEANS
    `the Authority varies, suspends or revokes a direction issued under section 41`

-- src:4108 | (7) Any direction issued to a person under subsection (2) has effect,
-- src:4109 | despite —
-- src:4111 | (a) the Business Trusts Act 2004, the Companies Act 1967, the
-- src:4112 | Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005, the Trustees Act
-- src:4113 | 1967 and the VCC Act;
-- src:4115 | [S 26/2022 wef 13/01/2022]
-- src:4117 | (b) anything in any listing rules as defined in section 2(1) of
-- src:4118 | the Securities and Futures Act 2001; and
-- src:4120 | (c) the provisions of the memorandum or articles of
-- src:4121 | association, trust deed or other constitution of the
-- src:4122 | specified person, designated telecommunication licensee,
-- src:4123 | designated business trust or designated trust.
@ref s 41(7) (src:4108-4123)
GIVEN `a direction was issued to a person under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 41(7): the direction has effect despite the Business Trusts Act 2004, the Companies Act 1967, the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005, the Trustees Act 1967, the VCC Act, any listing rules, and the constitution of the specified person, licensee, trust or designated trust` MEANS
    `a direction was issued to a person under subsection (2)`

-- src:4127 | (8) Subject to subsection (9), any person that contravenes
-- src:4128 | subsection (5) shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on
-- src:4129 | conviction —
-- src:4131 | (a) in the case of an individual, to a fine not exceeding
-- src:4132 | $125,000 or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding
-- src:4133 | 3 years or to both and, in the case of a continuing offence,
-- src:4134 | to a further fine not exceeding $12,500 for every day or
-- src:4135 | part of a day during which the offence continues after
-- src:4136 | conviction; or
-- src:4138 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:4139 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 84
-- src:4141 | (b) in any other case, to a fine not exceeding $250,000 and, in
-- src:4142 | the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine not
-- src:4143 | exceeding $25,000 for every day or part of a day during
-- src:4144 | which the offence continues after conviction.
@ref s 41(8) (src:4127-4144)
GIVEN `the person contravenes subsection (5)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an individual` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a telecommunication licensee that is the licensee, trustee-manager or trustee mentioned in subsection (2)(d)(ii)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `Penalty`
`s 41(8) and (9): the person is guilty of an offence and the most the penalty may be (the further daily fine is $12,500 for an individual, $25,000 otherwise)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (NOT `the person contravenes subsection (5)`) OR `the person is a telecommunication licensee that is the licensee, trustee-manager or trustee mentioned in subsection (2)(d)(ii)` THEN NOTHING
           IF `the person is an individual` THEN JUST (`Penalty` OF 125000, 36, 12500, FALSE)
           OTHERWISE JUST (`Penalty` OF 250000, 0, 25000, FALSE)

-- src:4148 | (9) Subsection (8) does not apply to a telecommunication licensee
-- src:4149 | that is —
-- src:4151 | (a) a designated telecommunication licensee mentioned in
-- src:4152 | subsection (2)(d)(ii);
-- src:4154 | (b) a trustee‑manager of the designated business trust
-- src:4155 | mentioned in subsection (2)(d)(ii); or
-- src:4157 | (c) a trustee of the designated trust mentioned in
-- src:4158 | subsection (2)(d)(ii).
-- src:4159 | [32DA
@ref s 41(9) (src:4148-4159)
GIVEN `the person is a designated telecommunication licensee mentioned in subsection (2)(d)(ii)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a trustee-manager of the designated business trust mentioned in subsection (2)(d)(ii)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a trustee of the designated trust mentioned in subsection (2)(d)(ii)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 41(9): subsection (8) applies to the telecommunication licensee` MEANS
    NOT (`the person is a designated telecommunication licensee mentioned in subsection (2)(d)(ii)` OR `the person is a trustee-manager of the designated business trust mentioned in subsection (2)(d)(ii)` OR `the person is a trustee of the designated trust mentioned in subsection (2)(d)(ii)`)

§ `s 42 Power of Authority to obtain information relating to control`

-- src:4167 | 42.—(1) Without affecting sections 31 and 78, the Authority may,
-- src:4168 | by written notice —
-- src:4170 | (a) direct any designated telecommunication licensee, trustee-
-- src:4171 | manager of any designated business trust or trustee of any
-- src:4172 | designated trust to obtain from a holder of shares, units or
-- src:4173 | equity interests in the designated telecommunication
-- src:4174 | licensee, designated business trust or designated trust (as
-- src:4175 | the case may be) and to provide to the Authority within
-- src:4176 | such time as may be specified in the notice, any
-- src:4177 | information relating to the holder that may be required to
-- src:4178 | ascertain or investigate the holding of shares, units or
-- src:4179 | equity interests or control of voting power in the
-- src:4180 | designated telecommunication licensee, designated
-- src:4181 | business trust or designated trust (as the case may be)
-- src:4182 | for the purposes of this Part; and
-- src:4184 | (b) direct any person to provide to the Authority, within such
-- src:4185 | time as may be specified in the notice, any information
-- src:4187 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:4188 | 85 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:4190 | required to ascertain or investigate the holding of any
-- src:4191 | shares, units or equity interests or control of voting power
-- src:4192 | in a designated telecommunication licensee, designated
-- src:4193 | business trust or a designated trust for the purposes of this
-- src:4194 | Part.
@ref s 42(1) (src:4167-4194)
GIVEN `the notice is in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the information relates to the holder and is required to ascertain or investigate the holding of shares, units or equity interests or control of voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 42(1): the Authority may direct the licensee, trustee-manager, trustee, or any person, to provide the information within the time specified` MEANS
    `the notice is in writing` AND `the information relates to the holder and is required to ascertain or investigate the holding of shares, units or equity interests or control of voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust`

-- src:4198 | (2) The Authority may, by written notice —
-- src:4200 | (a) direct any shareholder of a designated telecommunication
-- src:4201 | licensee to provide to the Authority, within such time as
-- src:4202 | may be specified in the notice, the following information:
-- src:4204 | (i) whether that shareholder holds any voting share in
-- src:4205 | the designated telecommunication licensee as a
-- src:4206 | trustee; and
-- src:4208 | (ii) if so —
-- src:4210 | (A) the name of the person for whom that
-- src:4211 | shareholder holds the voting share as a
-- src:4212 | trustee, or such other particulars as are
-- src:4213 | sufficient to enable the identification of that
-- src:4214 | person; and
-- src:4216 | (B) the nature of that person’s interest;
-- src:4218 | (b) direct any unitholder of a designated business trust to
-- src:4219 | provide to the Authority, within such time as may be
-- src:4220 | specified in the notice, the following information:
-- src:4222 | (i) whether that unitholder holds any unit in the
-- src:4223 | designated business trust as a trustee; and
-- src:4225 | (ii) if so —
-- src:4227 | (A) the name of the person for whom that
-- src:4228 | unitholder holds the unit as a trustee, or such
-- src:4229 | other particulars as are sufficient to enable the
-- src:4230 | identification of that person; and
-- src:4232 | (B) the nature of that person’s interest; and
-- src:4234 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:4235 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 86
-- src:4237 | (c) direct any holder of equity interests in a designated trust to
-- src:4238 | provide to the Authority, within such time as may be
-- src:4239 | specified in the notice, the following information:
-- src:4241 | (i) whether that holder holds any equity interest in the
-- src:4242 | designated trust as a trustee; and
-- src:4244 | (ii) if so —
-- src:4246 | (A) the name of the person for whom that holder
-- src:4247 | holds the equity interest as a trustee, or such
-- src:4248 | other particulars as are sufficient to enable the
-- src:4249 | identification of that person; and
-- src:4251 | (B) the nature of that person’s interest. [19/2011]
@ref s 42(2) (src:4198-4251)
GIVEN `the person is a shareholder of a designated telecommunication licensee, a unitholder of a designated business trust, or a holder of equity interests in a designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice is in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 42(2): the Authority may direct the person to provide, within the time specified, whether the person holds the voting share, unit or equity interest as a trustee and, if so, the name or identifying particulars of the person for whom it is held and the nature of that person's interest` MEANS
    `the person is a shareholder of a designated telecommunication licensee, a unitholder of a designated business trust, or a holder of equity interests in a designated trust` AND `the notice is in writing`

-- src:4252 | (3) Any person who —
-- src:4254 | (a) fails to comply with a notice under subsection (1) or (2); or
-- src:4256 | (b) in purported compliance with a notice under subsection (1)
-- src:4257 | or (2), knowingly or recklessly makes a statement which is
-- src:4258 | false in a material particular,
-- src:4260 | shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on conviction —
-- src:4262 | (c) in the case of an individual, to a fine not exceeding
-- src:4263 | $125,000 or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding
-- src:4264 | 3 years or to both and, in the case of a continuing offence,
-- src:4265 | to a further fine not exceeding $12,500 for every day or
-- src:4266 | part of a day during which the offence continues after
-- src:4267 | conviction; or
-- src:4269 | (d) in any other case, to a fine not exceeding $250,000 and, in
-- src:4270 | the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine not
-- src:4271 | exceeding $25,000 for every day or part of a day during
-- src:4272 | which the offence continues after conviction.
@ref s 42(3) (src:4252-4272)
GIVEN `the person fails to comply with a notice under subsection (1) or (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person, in purported compliance with a notice, knowingly or recklessly makes a statement which is false in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an individual` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `Penalty`
`s 42(3): the person is guilty of an offence and the most the penalty may be (the further daily fine is $12,500 for an individual, $25,000 otherwise)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF NOT (`the person fails to comply with a notice under subsection (1) or (2)` OR `the person, in purported compliance with a notice, knowingly or recklessly makes a statement which is false in a material particular`) THEN NOTHING
           IF `the person is an individual` THEN JUST (`Penalty` OF 125000, 36, 12500, FALSE)
           OTHERWISE JUST (`Penalty` OF 250000, 0, 25000, FALSE)

§ `s 43 Appointment of chief executive officer, director, etc., of designated telecommunication licensee`

-- src:4283 | 43.—(1) A designated telecommunication licensee must not
-- src:4284 | appoint a person as its chief executive officer, its director or the
-- src:4285 | chairperson of its board of directors, unless it has obtained the
-- src:4286 | approval of the Authority to do so.
@ref s 43(1) (src:4283-4286)
GIVEN `the designated telecommunication licensee appoints a person as its chief executive officer, its director or the chairperson of its board of directors` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the licensee obtained the approval of the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 43(1): the licensee may make the appointment` MEANS
    (NOT `the designated telecommunication licensee appoints a person as its chief executive officer, its director or the chairperson of its board of directors`) OR `the licensee obtained the approval of the Authority`

-- src:4290 | (2) The Authority may —
-- src:4292 | (a) grant its approval, without or with conditions, such
-- src:4293 | conditions limited to either or both of the following:
-- src:4295 | (i) specifying the period of appointment for which the
-- src:4296 | approval is granted, including any requirement for
-- src:4297 | the designated telecommunication licensee to seek
-- src:4298 | approval for re‑appointment;
-- src:4300 | (ii) specifying the actions to be taken by the designated
-- src:4301 | telecommunication licensee or the person appointed;
-- src:4302 | and
-- src:4304 | (b) at any time add to, vary or revoke any condition of the
-- src:4305 | approval under paragraph (a), subject to the limitation in
-- src:4306 | that paragraph.
@ref s 43(2) (src:4290-4306)
GIVEN condition IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 43(2): the Authority may attach this condition to its approval, and may add to, vary or revoke it` MEANS
    elem condition (LIST "specifying the period of appointment for which the approval is granted, including any requirement for the licensee to seek approval for re-appointment"
                        , "specifying the actions to be taken by the designated telecommunication licensee or the person appointed")

-- src:4310 | (3) Where a designated telecommunication licensee appoints a
-- src:4311 | person as its chief executive officer, its director or the chairperson of
-- src:4312 | its board of directors without the approval of the Authority, in
-- src:4313 | contravention of subsection (1), or the designated telecommunication
-- src:4314 | licensee or the person appointed is in contravention of any of the
-- src:4315 | conditions imposed under subsection (2), the Authority may issue a
-- src:4316 | direction to the licensee to remove that person from his or her
-- src:4317 | appointment as chief executive officer, director or chairperson of the
-- src:4318 | board of directors (as the case may be) of the licensee.
@ref s 43(3) (src:4310-4318)
GIVEN `the licensee appointed the person without the approval of the Authority, in contravention of subsection (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the licensee or the person appointed is in contravention of a condition imposed under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 43(3): the Authority may direct the licensee to remove the person from the appointment` MEANS
    `the licensee appointed the person without the approval of the Authority, in contravention of subsection (1)` OR `the licensee or the person appointed is in contravention of a condition imposed under subsection (2)`

-- src:4322 | (4) The Authority may at any time vary, suspend or revoke any
-- src:4323 | direction issued under subsection (3).
@ref s 43(4) (src:4322-4323)
GIVEN `the Authority varies, suspends or revokes a direction issued under subsection (3)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 43(4): the Authority may at any time vary, suspend or revoke the direction` MEANS
    `the Authority varies, suspends or revokes a direction issued under subsection (3)`

-- src:4327 | (5) This section has effect despite the provisions of any other
-- src:4328 | written law and the provisions of the memorandum or articles of
-- src:4330 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:4331 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 88
-- src:4333 | association, or other constitution, of the designated
-- src:4334 | telecommunication licensee.
@ref s 43(5) (src:4327-4334)
GIVEN `a licensee is subject to section 43` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 43(5): section 43 has effect despite any other written law and the memorandum or articles of association, or other constitution, of the licensee` MEANS
    `a licensee is subject to section 43`

-- src:4338 | (6) In this section —
-- src:4340 | “chief executive officer”, in relation to a designated
-- src:4341 | telecommunication licensee —
-- src:4343 | (a) means any person, by whatever name described,
-- src:4344 | who —
-- src:4346 | (i) is in the direct employment of, or acting for or
-- src:4347 | by arrangement with, the designated
-- src:4348 | telecommunication licensee; and
-- src:4350 | (ii) is principally responsible for the management
-- src:4351 | and conduct of any type of business of the
-- src:4352 | designated telecommunication licensee in
-- src:4353 | Singapore; and
-- src:4355 | (b) includes any person for the time being performing all
-- src:4356 | or any of the functions or duties of a chief executive
-- src:4357 | officer;
-- src:4359 | “director” has the meaning given by section 4(1) of the
-- src:4360 | Companies Act 1967.
-- src:4362 | [32F
@ref s 43(6) (src:4338-4362)
GIVEN `the person is in the direct employment of, or acting for or by arrangement with, the designated telecommunication licensee, and is principally responsible for the management and conduct of any type of business of the licensee in Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person for the time being performs all or any of the functions or duties of a chief executive officer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 43(6): this person is the "chief executive officer" of the designated telecommunication licensee` MEANS
    `the person is in the direct employment of, or acting for or by arrangement with, the designated telecommunication licensee, and is principally responsible for the management and conduct of any type of business of the licensee in Singapore` OR `the person for the time being performs all or any of the functions or duties of a chief executive officer`

GIVEN `it has the meaning section 4(1) of the Companies Act 1967 gives director` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 43(6): this is a "director"` MEANS
    `it has the meaning section 4(1) of the Companies Act 1967 gives director`
